 be strong in the story  garp whitebeard kaido shiki big mom  rocks himself  what a goddamn monster  there are usually three ways to raise  your bounty in the one piece worlds  be extremely strong be extremely  influential or actively try to work  against the established world order well  as you know raja did all three of these  things  quite successfully i would say and so  it's no real surprise that the most  legendary character in one piece ended  up with the  most legendary bounty  now if this wasn't enough legendary old  guy for you yet  i strongly recommend you watch this  video on rayleigh or  this one on garb next thanks for  watching
 

